.nh
.TH runc-delete "8"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
\fBrunc-delete\fP \- delete any resources held by the container


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrunc delete\fP [\fB--force\fP|\fB-f\fP] \fIcontainer-id\fP


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB--force\fP|\fB-f\fP
Forcibly delete the running container, using \fBSIGKILL\fP \fBsignal\fP(7)
to stop it first.


.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
If the container id is \fBubuntu01\fP and \fBrunc list\fP currently shows
its status as \fBstopped\fP, the following will delete resources held for
\fBubuntu01\fP, removing it from the \fBrunc list\fP:

.EX
# runc delete ubuntu01
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBrunc-kill\fP(8),
\fBrunc\fP(8).
